1
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,480
Class dismissed.

2
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:41,840
Let's go.

3
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:44,599
Want to hit the store?

4
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,599
I'm thirsty.

5
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,079
Sure, I need something too.

6
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,400
Gu Chenyang.

7
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,640
Ms. Du.

8
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,879
I think you're good at chemistry.

9
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:52,799
How about

10
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,079
being my class rep?

11
00:01:54,599 --> 00:01:55,959
Thanks, Ms. Du.

12
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:56,640
But I'm already

13
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,719
the physics representative.

14
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,719
You can take on both roles.

15
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:01,840
I'm also in a club.

16
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,400
I'm afraid I can't handle it.

17
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,439
I'm sorry, sir.

18
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:05,879
Okay.

19
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,200
Good luck.

20
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,360
Okay.

21
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,800
That's all

22
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,919
for today's class.

23
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,280
Wanliu

24
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,680
Please tidy up the table.

25
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,800
OK, teacher.

26
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:25,159
Xu Anbo, wait.

27
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:25,759
What's up?

28
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,080
I've heard

29
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,639
you played basketball in junior high.

30
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,919
Why don't you join our basketball club?

31
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,639
No, thanks.

32
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:32,960
I like photography.

33
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,159
I can take photos myself.

34
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:38,520
Is there a photography club in our school?

35
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,439
No.

36
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,439
That's great.

37
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:42,280
You should

38
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,360
join our basketball club.

39
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,400
You can take pictures of sports.

40
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:46,719
It's more exciting, right?

41
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,719
What do you usually take pictures of?

42
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,159
I usually take pictures of...

43
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:53,879
Brother.

44
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,240
Who is she?

45
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,159
This is my sister, Chi Jia.

46
00:03:00,599 --> 00:03:01,319
Sister?

47
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:03,159
I take my mom's last name,

48
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,080
and she takes my dad's.

49
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,599
Chi Jia,

50
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:06,879
this is my deskmate, Lin Qingyuan.

51
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:07,479
Hello.

52
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:08,759
I know you.

53
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,360
You're famous for the opening ceremony.

54
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:12,800
Yeah.

55
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,159
Chi Jia,

56
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:15,280
what's up?

57
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,479
Dad texted you

58
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:18,000
to go home early today

59
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,560
and take photos for the new students.

60
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:21,039
Why didn't you reply?

61
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,439
I know, don't remind me.

62
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:25,400
Hurry up then.

63
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,120
I'm off, bye.

64
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,919
So this is what you usually shoot.

65
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,120
It's good.

66
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:41,240
It's a shame

67
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,039
to waste such a good camera.

68
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,719
But it's okay

69
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:49,960
if you don't have time.

70
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:52,280
I'll figure it out myself.

71
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:54,400
I can't force you.

72
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,520
What's wrong?

73
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:03,159
Lin Qingyuan,

74
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,159
how about

75
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,120
I give it a try?

76
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,199
No need.

77
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,240
You can do it.

78
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,599
Okay.

79
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,599
But let's make a deal.

80
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:14,680
Call me if you need me.

81
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,519
Don't control me if you don't need me.

82
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,240
No problem. It's a deal.

83
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,560
Let's go.

84
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:30,360
Here you are.

85
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,040
Thank you.

86
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,959
Thank you.

87
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,240
Come and have a look, please.

88
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,839
One more to go.

89
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:39,319
Zhou Yang, how about you?

90
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,279
I've contacted all the old members.

91
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:44,399
They either didn't reply or refused.

92
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:46,319
Hey, check out the street dance club.

93
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,920
What about Fu Bin Yan?

94
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,439
He's also good at basketball.

95
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:51,360
Aren't you the "Yi Bei Twins"?

96
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,800
Once Fu Bin Yan decides something,

97
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,439
it's hard to change his mind.

98
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,240
What about Gu Chenyang?

99
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:04,879
We need to submit the club application tomorrow morning.

100
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:06,240
Does he have a team spirit?

101
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,319
I'm the one who recruited all these people.

102
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,720
As the temporary leader,

103
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,120
he should do something.

104
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,079
He just came by,

105
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,920
saying he thought of someone who might be interested,

106
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,680
and then hurried off.

107
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,519
Who is it?

108
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,879
Solo time.

109
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,720
Guitar.

110
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,639
Keyboard.

111
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,199
Trumpet.

112
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,680
Very good.

113
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:06,759
The whole part falls apart.

114
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,519
But it doesn't matter.

115
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,639
It's the first joint practice.

116
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:11,839
Continue next time.

117
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:12,920
Yu.

118
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,519
Actually, our band

119
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:17,600
can't even recruit enough members for the club.

120
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,720
Except for you,

121
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,399
everyone else is just playing around.

122
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,160
How about

123
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:22,759
we just forget about the band?

124
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:24,079
Playing in a band,

125
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,959
the most important thing is to have fun.

126
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:27,639
You guys can join the club if you want.

127
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,079
I'll cover the costs myself.

128
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,399
Don't feel pressured.

129
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,319
You are not welcome here.

130
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,519
You'd better leave.

131
00:06:58,959 --> 00:07:00,240
I'm here to ask you

132
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:02,000
if you want to play basketball with me.

133
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,720
Are we very familiar?

134
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,439
If it weren't for your basketball team being short of people,

135
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,160
would you have thought of me?

136
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,879
I would rather not join the club

137
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,240
than be your tool to make up the numbers.

138
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,839
Your drumsticks

139
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:22,839
have been used for a long time, haven't they?

140
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,800
Come to the basketball club,

141
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,279
I'll give you a new one.

142
00:07:32,879 --> 00:07:34,079
Don't be so self-righteous.

143
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,920
This is not the one you gave me.

144
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,040
Well,

145
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:45,079
either you join my band,

146
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,800
or you

147
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,360
leave here.

148
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:13,959
Let's have a match.

149
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,639
Match what?

150
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,519
Basketball.

151
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:20,879
One on one.

152
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:23,199
If you win, I'll listen to you.

153
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:24,759
I'll join your band.

154
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,120
If I win,

155
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,360
you'll join the basketball club.

156
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,919
Interesting.

157
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,399
Let's do it.

158
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,639
These two are going one on one.

159
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,879
Let's see who's better.

160
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:41,799
One on one.

161
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,720
One on one.

162
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:43,639
What are you doing?

163
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:44,559
One-on-one.

164
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,519
You've been a top student

165
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,919
and a tennis player.

166
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,960
Are you still good at basketball?

167
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,480
I'm better than you at playing drums.

168
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,919
Whoever gets 11 points first

169
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,279
wins.

170
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,320
No problem.

171
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,080
You serve first.

172
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:15,360
As you wish.

173
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:18,360
Come on!

174
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,720
Gu Chenyang!

175
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,720
Come on!

176
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,720
Yu, come on!

177
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:29,759
Excuse me.

178
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,320
Nice shot!

179
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,279
My turn.

180
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:43,519
So Gu Chenyang was trying to

181
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,559
Li Haoyu.

182
00:09:44,799 --> 00:09:45,639
He can play basketball.

183
00:09:47,159 --> 00:09:47,840
When he was in junior high school,

184
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,200
the basketball club once specially recruited him.

185
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:51,279
But he thought there were too many rules

186
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:51,919
and it was not free.

187
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,080
So he didn't go.

188
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,120
Come on!

189
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,799
Come on!

190
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,879
Good shot!

191
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,440
This is awesome!

192
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,639
Oh my god.

193
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,759
Come on.

194
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,279
Left hand.

195
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,279
Three points.

196
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,279
Nice.

197
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,039
This boy.

198
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,200
What a coincidence.

199
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:16,960
Bro.

200
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,600
This is the legend

201
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,559
of your school.

202
00:11:19,559 --> 00:11:20,360
It's him.

203
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,720
Amazing!

204
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,120
Why is he here?

205
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,399
So handsome!

206
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,919
Good shot!

207
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,600
Good!

208
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,960
Good!

209
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,519
Amazing!

210
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,320
I won!

211
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,159
So handsome!

212
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:38,320
A bet is a bet.

213
00:11:39,919 --> 00:11:41,159
I'm joining the basketball club.

214
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,080
You three don't have a club.

215
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,000
Do you want to join us?

216
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,279
Yu, we'll listen to you.

217
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,759
Okay.

218
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,799
From now on,

219
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,480
Pulse Star Band

220
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,720
will join the club together.

221
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:55,399
Welcome to Yibei Basketball Club.

222
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,200
How about two more games?

223
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,399
Let's go.

224
00:12:06,679 --> 00:12:07,960
See you.

225
00:12:11,639 --> 00:12:12,720
You are...

226
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:15,639
Wait.

227
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:16,840
How can you...

228
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,919
What do you want to say?

229
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,240
Do you often

230
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,240
play basketball here?

231
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,240
It's really you.

232
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,200
How can it be you?

233
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:31,080
Don't go, captain.

234
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,440
You admit that I'm the captain now?

235
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,159
Yeah.

236
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:39,799
You're the captain.

237
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,519
Can you

238
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:43,559
teach me how to play?

239
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,799
Isn't that what a captain does?

240
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,080
Great, thank you.

241
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:15,759
Fu Bin Yan.

242
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,639
I didn't expect you to come.

243
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,639
What a game.

244
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,600
Don't you think

245
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,600
Gu Chenyang's style of playing

246
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,519
is very similar to yours?

247
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,440
More like himself.

248
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,279
Every step is planned.

249
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:42,519
True.

250
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:45,200
You have more explosive power than him.

251
00:13:49,799 --> 00:13:50,519
How about it?

252
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,559
Do you want to come back?

253
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,120
No.

254
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,120
Zhou Yang

255
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,120
has a new teammate.

256
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,879
You can do better.

257
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:28,399
Coach.

258
00:14:30,679 --> 00:14:31,519
Coach.

259
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,000
I'm not sleeping.

260
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,200
Coach.

261
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,279
Look.

262
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,279
You've really gathered a team.

263
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:44,879
Coach.

264
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:45,799
When can we

265
00:14:45,799 --> 00:14:46,759
start training?

266
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,399
You can't.

267
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,679
Here,

268
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,240
read it yourself.

269
00:14:54,919 --> 00:14:56,039
A new notice.

270
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,559
Due to the surge in

271
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:02,080
club applications this year,

272
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,720
the school board has decided

273
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,279
to conduct a week-long comprehensive evaluation

274
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,960
of all clubs.

275
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:10,440
Only the top 15

276
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,360
with the highest scores

277
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,360
the top 15 clubs.

278
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,200
What does it mean, Mr. Su?

279
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,519
What's our ranking?

280
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:24,919
All newly applied clubs

281
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:27,159
start with zero points.

282
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,519
So,

283
00:15:28,519 --> 00:15:29,639
we're at the bottom.

284
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,200
At the bottom?

285
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,600
At the bottom?

286
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,519
We're at the bottom.

287
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,559
It's not too late to run.

288
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:42,039
I have a buddy in the roller skating club.

289
00:15:42,399 --> 00:15:43,519
He said there are still vacancies.

290
00:15:46,879 --> 00:15:47,639
No.

291
00:15:47,639 --> 00:15:49,200
I've already decided to play basketball.

292
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,519
How could I betray?

293
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,480
You're quite loyal.

294
00:15:53,679 --> 00:15:54,279
It was not easy for us

295
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,960
to re-establish the basketball club.

296
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:57,399
We have to fight hard

297
00:15:57,399 --> 00:15:58,200
to keep it.

298
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,600
