The back alley of the canteen

593
00:26:58,599 --> 00:27:00,279
is the best place to trade snacks.

594
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,119
With it,

595
00:27:01,119 --> 00:27:01,799
you can catch

596
00:27:01,799 --> 00:27:03,359
students breaking rules.

597
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:08,119
Li Haoyu, what are you doing?

598
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:11,079
I used to be immature

599
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:12,599
and always made you angry.

600
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,160
Now I understand,

601
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,920
what the school needs is order,

602
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:17,599
and I'm willing to be your enforcer.
